{"3819710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fortified Space", "steam_appid": 3819710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3887940], "detailed_description": "<h1>As Seen On</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/edd57ff921517de2fe3e72912ce5f7b1.avif?t=1782415910\" width=396 height=86 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/d9dbb2f16e325a3f4be4334de53cbef9.avif?t=1782415910\" width=396 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/df33067fe6f6c04acf7432c606f25be1.avif?t=1782415910\" width=396 height=86 /></span> </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e0cef6335fc0906f0cde1660b55965a4.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e0cef6335fc0906f0cde1660b55965a4.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e0cef6335fc0906f0cde1660b55965a4.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain of a Unified Earth Forces starship, leading daring combat missions deep into enemy territory.  Fight in space and on the ground as you spearhead the assault, establish vital footholds, and pave the way for  Marine landing forces. Engage in ship-to-ship combat, build bases on planet surfaces, and shred enemies with turrets and your assault rifle alike.  Turn the tide in a war for humanity's survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Intense Space Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills as a starship captain as you evade hostile fire, strafe alien cruisers, and escort allied ships during fleet battles.  Blast incoming missiles with your ship's point-defense turret and strike hard with your railguns.  Dominate the fight and secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/09a39da9f24123ea58479b20cd921c67.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/09a39da9f24123ea58479b20cd921c67.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/09a39da9f24123ea58479b20cd921c67.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/7049cc82dfaf04f584904fa2e85671e2.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/7049cc82dfaf04f584904fa2e85671e2.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/7049cc82dfaf04f584904fa2e85671e2.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/d8682f15dc2091b4d94c4b59f2032b68.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/d8682f15dc2091b4d94c4b59f2032b68.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/d8682f15dc2091b4d94c4b59f2032b68.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Defend Planetary Fortifications</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think strategically as you deploy barriers, turrets, gates, and barbed wire on hostile planets to safeguard against relentless waves of enemies.  Or, if it's been a long day, maybe you can just build a wall of turrets.  The enemy will get the message.  Each planet has unique characteristics, but the objective is almost always the same: create a secure zone to allow our Marines to land safely.  After reinforcements arrive and you've succeeded in your mission, you can toggle <strong>Endless Mode</strong> to activate nonstop enemy attacks.<strong> </strong>Keep coming back to the planet to work on your base and fight off this relentless assault!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8a67c7e74f618076c37ea1825e69da02.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8a67c7e74f618076c37ea1825e69da02.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8a67c7e74f618076c37ea1825e69da02.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/5f8fed149b578577ae4a2861176b766c.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/5f8fed149b578577ae4a2861176b766c.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/5f8fed149b578577ae4a2861176b766c.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/c251ab929d74b495d86c5720aa600ceb.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/c251ab929d74b495d86c5720aa600ceb.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/c251ab929d74b495d86c5720aa600ceb.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b9eda83315c50c5b4a0ac997755d580e.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b9eda83315c50c5b4a0ac997755d580e.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b9eda83315c50c5b4a0ac997755d580e.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/572a596a70a189a26f8c574159cad889.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/572a596a70a189a26f8c574159cad889.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/572a596a70a189a26f8c574159cad889.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Your Ship - Farm, Mine, Read, and Relax</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortified Space offers more than just adrenaline-pumping combat.  Take a break from the fight to walk around your ship, talk to your crew, and read the news articles that update after each mission.  Gather materials for your next mission through asteroid mining, hydroponic farming, and composting.  You can even kick around a soccer ball or play a target-shooting arcade game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6d1ee44ef7eddcc60994999ca8e6cc13.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6d1ee44ef7eddcc60994999ca8e6cc13.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6d1ee44ef7eddcc60994999ca8e6cc13.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Earth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for shore leave?  Fly to Earth and explore the civic and cultural institutions in humanity's capital.  Don't forget to visit the Library of Earth to read about the Interplanetary War, Unified Earth Forces ships, and other interesting topics. Earth will be an area for continued growth during Early Access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8382ce516823a641514b047b30283641.avif?t=1782415910\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/76e93f1cade6b0b433db9590b73505a0.avif?t=1782415910\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/222f3cbfebc13dd33bf8693673526f4e.avif?t=1782415910\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e67f12d236d4ea4dc5b55827503088db.avif?t=1782415910\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b4e25bfddb2e18eb2cc78b2b7c03afd1.avif?t=1782415910\" width=1454 height=744 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Report to your ship and prepare for launch.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good hunting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/49598afb543e6e0e1c4600996a3eb827.avif?t=1782415910\" width=375 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Special thanks to Richard Wei, MVP (Most Valuable Playtester)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nightsail Game Studios logo by Alexis Paneda and Gian Paneda</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e0cef6335fc0906f0cde1660b55965a4.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e0cef6335fc0906f0cde1660b55965a4.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e0cef6335fc0906f0cde1660b55965a4.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain of a Unified Earth Forces starship, leading daring combat missions deep into enemy territory.  Fight in space and on the ground as you spearhead the assault, establish vital footholds, and pave the way for  Marine landing forces. Engage in ship-to-ship combat, build bases on planet surfaces, and shred enemies with turrets and your assault rifle alike.  Turn the tide in a war for humanity's survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Intense Space Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills as a starship captain as you evade hostile fire, strafe alien cruisers, and escort allied ships during fleet battles.  Blast incoming missiles with your ship's point-defense turret and strike hard with your railguns.  Dominate the fight and secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/1c61f537e68c9c74946feee12e365e5c.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/09a39da9f24123ea58479b20cd921c67.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/09a39da9f24123ea58479b20cd921c67.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/09a39da9f24123ea58479b20cd921c67.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/7049cc82dfaf04f584904fa2e85671e2.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/7049cc82dfaf04f584904fa2e85671e2.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/7049cc82dfaf04f584904fa2e85671e2.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/d8682f15dc2091b4d94c4b59f2032b68.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/d8682f15dc2091b4d94c4b59f2032b68.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/d8682f15dc2091b4d94c4b59f2032b68.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Defend Planetary Fortifications</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think strategically as you deploy barriers, turrets, gates, and barbed wire on hostile planets to safeguard against relentless waves of enemies.  Or, if it's been a long day, maybe you can just build a wall of turrets.  The enemy will get the message.  Each planet has unique characteristics, but the objective is almost always the same: create a secure zone to allow our Marines to land safely.  After reinforcements arrive and you've succeeded in your mission, you can toggle <strong>Endless Mode</strong> to activate nonstop enemy attacks.<strong> </strong>Keep coming back to the planet to work on your base and fight off this relentless assault!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8a67c7e74f618076c37ea1825e69da02.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8a67c7e74f618076c37ea1825e69da02.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8a67c7e74f618076c37ea1825e69da02.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/63cc87337f38e0b3057565cee867250c.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/4655253f176cd2418f0bcf471141f501.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/5f8fed149b578577ae4a2861176b766c.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/5f8fed149b578577ae4a2861176b766c.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/5f8fed149b578577ae4a2861176b766c.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/c251ab929d74b495d86c5720aa600ceb.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/c251ab929d74b495d86c5720aa600ceb.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/c251ab929d74b495d86c5720aa600ceb.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b9eda83315c50c5b4a0ac997755d580e.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b9eda83315c50c5b4a0ac997755d580e.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b9eda83315c50c5b4a0ac997755d580e.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/572a596a70a189a26f8c574159cad889.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/572a596a70a189a26f8c574159cad889.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/572a596a70a189a26f8c574159cad889.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Your Ship - Farm, Mine, Read, and Relax</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortified Space offers more than just adrenaline-pumping combat.  Take a break from the fight to walk around your ship, talk to your crew, and read the news articles that update after each mission.  Gather materials for your next mission through asteroid mining, hydroponic farming, and composting.  You can even kick around a soccer ball or play a target-shooting arcade game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/fc3e5254c4a259addc39fd6f1304c56d.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/3a69cd699facc01a7d3d0c2d930bf5bb.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/78f0bc5482f77a9d36b1bdaba0cd0962.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6d1ee44ef7eddcc60994999ca8e6cc13.poster.avif?t=1782415910\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6d1ee44ef7eddcc60994999ca8e6cc13.webm?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/6d1ee44ef7eddcc60994999ca8e6cc13.mp4?t=1782415910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Earth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for shore leave?  Fly to Earth and explore the civic and cultural institutions in humanity's capital.  Don't forget to visit the Library of Earth to read about the Interplanetary War, Unified Earth Forces ships, and other interesting topics. Earth will be an area for continued growth during Early Access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/8382ce516823a641514b047b30283641.avif?t=1782415910\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/76e93f1cade6b0b433db9590b73505a0.avif?t=1782415910\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/222f3cbfebc13dd33bf8693673526f4e.avif?t=1782415910\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/e67f12d236d4ea4dc5b55827503088db.avif?t=1782415910\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/b4e25bfddb2e18eb2cc78b2b7c03afd1.avif?t=1782415910\" width=1454 height=744 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Report to your ship and prepare for launch.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good hunting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/extras/49598afb543e6e0e1c4600996a3eb827.avif?t=1782415910\" width=375 height=129 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Special thanks to Richard Wei, MVP (Most Valuable Playtester)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nightsail Game Studios logo by Alexis Paneda and Gian Paneda</i></p>", "short_description": "Seize control of hostile planets in this nostalgic space sim and tower defense hybrid inspired by classic Flash games. Fight for orbital supremacy in starship combat, then land on the surface to build bases, deploy defenses, and shred enemies. Relax aboard your ship with farming, mining, and more.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Fortified Space offers an unique blend within the strategy genre. The game alternates between intense space battles and surface missions where the objective changes completely…this change of scenery is one of the game's most interesting ideas. [Translated from Spanish]”<br>Kotaku (Español)<br><br>“When one indie developer couldn’t find the sci-fi game of his dreams, he built it himself...this is one of the most promising sci-fi indies of 2025.”<br>Fix Gaming Channel<br><br>“The game's presentation was interesting; it has that charming sci-fi Newgrounds Flash feel, but updated in terms of broad gameplay and requiring a strategic approach to clear the objectives.”<br>We Playtest Games<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/c5cff8bd316d2f9dfe97e46e1a8e97b1cb937af7/header.jpg?t=1782415910", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/63989c8af143c35fdc8ea7176caa5fe83df9f570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782415910", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819710/63989c8af143c35fdc8ea7176caa5fe83df9f570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782415910", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 4700U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 9750H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requ